commit f9db1aedea69dc81b81930eb81008168934f5071
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:35:26 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee
    
    Built from incoming/tasks.csv (the 12 Nov export). Grouped by person so each
    member can find their own jobs (Ines, 12 Nov) and read names without scrolling
    sideways (Hal, 29 Oct); unowned jobs come first because that is what keeps
    stalling (water meter, shed gutter); done jobs are folded (Tomas, 12 Nov).
    
    The kit gains opt-in options for this (section order by name, done fold, date
    columns with overdue/this-week flags, value prefixes). The events board uses
    none of them; its page content is unchanged.
    
    Data import: qty merged into notes, 'Done' -> 'done', 'priya' -> 'Priya'.
    The polytunnel rota columns were not carried over; see incoming/tasks.csv.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

